• Field_4 currently shows the highest bird–threat level (0.26) and requires 3 drones for full protection. The three drones that are already close to Field_4 (Drone_2, Drone_5, and Drone_8) are hence maintained in that group.
• Field_3 – the next most threatened field (threat level 0.07, needing 2 drones) – is already fully protected by Drone_1 and Drone_4.
